  "text": "proprium.omnium-sanctorum-offertorium",
  "about": "The offertorium of the formulary “All Saints” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": {
      "translation": "The souls of the just are in the hand of God, and no torment shall touch them. They seemed, in the view of the foolish, to be dead: but they are in peace, alleluia. (sed post Septuagesimam dicitur) peace."
    }
  },
